{"q":"516","t":"Longest Palindromic Subsequence","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given a string <code>s</code>, find <em>the longest palindromic <strong>subsequence</strong>&#39;s length in</em> <code>s</code>.</p>\n\n<p>A <strong>subsequence</strong> is a sequence that can be derived from another sequence by deleting some or no elements without changing the order of the remaining elements.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> s = &quot;bbbab&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> 4\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> One possible longest palindromic subsequence is &quot;bbbb&quot;.\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> s = &quot;cbbd&quot;\n<strong>Output:</strong> 2\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> One possible longest palindromic subsequence is &quot;bb&quot;.\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>1 &lt;= s.length &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n\t<li><code>s</code> consists only of lowercase English letters.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"longestPalindromeSubseq\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"s\",\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n","g":[{"name":"String","slug":"string"},{"name":"Dynamic Programming","slug":"dynamic-programming"}],"s":[{"t":"Longest Palindromic Substring","s":"longest-palindromic-substring","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Palindromic Substrings","s":"palindromic-substrings","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Count Different Palindromic Subsequences","s":"count-different-palindromic-subsequences","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Longest Common Subsequence","s":"longest-common-subsequence","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Longest Palindromic Subsequence II","s":"longest-palindromic-subsequence-ii","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Maximize Palindrome Length From Subsequences","s":"maximize-palindrome-length-from-subsequences","d":"Hard","p":false},{"t":"Maximum Product of the Length of Two Palindromic Subsequences","s":"maximum-product-of-the-length-of-two-palindromic-subsequences","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["LinkedIn","linkedin"],["tcs","tcs"],["JPMorgan Chase","jpmorgan"],["Infosys","infosys"],["Meta","facebook"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Uber","uber"]],"cs":{"a":[["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs",11],["Google","google",2],["Microsoft","microsoft",2]],"b":[["Meta","facebook",2],["Amazon","amazon",2]],"m":[["LinkedIn","linkedin",14],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",5],["tcs","tcs",3],["Infosys","infosys",2],["Nutanix","nutanix",2],["MAQ Software","maq-software",2]]}}